      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a relief to admit that the story was just a story, and the universe is indeed cold and indifferent to your suffering. Since there is no divine plan to follow, you are free to choose your own path, which can be the most honest and liberating thing to do. The point of trying to get through the day is simply to find the small, fleeting moments of connection or beauty that exist in the void, even if they are fleeting. You don't need a grand purpose to make your life worth living; sometimes, just being present is enough.",
